    "created_at": "2016-05-05T16:29:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-05T16:29:02Z",
    "body": "I think autofocus should work only if the host was also focused.  Otherwise, component users would be forced to avoid using components that uses `autofocus` attribute in its shadow tree.\n\nA better behavior would be that when a component is focused and `delegatesFocus` is true, the focus goes to the element with `autofocus` attribute.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
