    "created_at": "2017-09-05T10:19:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-05T10:19:49Z",
    "body": "@rniwa it's not exactly clear what you're proposing here. Currently `autofocus` only applies to `button`, `input`, `select`, and `textarea`. Rather than inventing a new model for `autofocus`, it seems much easier to allow components to use `autofocus`. You can simply avoid using components that abuse it or don't allow you to configure whether it's used.",
