    "body": "In particular, in the current spec, if you put `autofocus` on a `delegatesFocus = true` shadow root, then the autofocus algorithm will focus the first flat-tree-descendant *focusable area*. But what we want is to find the first flat-tree-descendant *with the autofocus attribute*.",
