    "created_at": "2021-08-23T21:57:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-23T21:57:22Z",
    "body": "> In particular, in the current spec, if you put `autofocus` on a `delegatesFocus = true` shadow root, then the autofocus algorithm will focus the first flat-tree-descendant _focusable area_. But what we want is to find the first flat-tree-descendant _with the autofocus attribute_.\r\n\r\nRight. WebKit doesn't have autofocus attribute implemented for non-form-control element so we need to update our implementation first but implementing this new behavior sounds good to me.",
